
  ========================================================================
    COMPAQ PORTABLE III                                 Raspberry Pi link
  ========================================================================

  Hello! This is a 1987 Compaq, brought back to life by a Raspberry Pi.
  Play a game, read a repair guide, ask FixBot about a repair, or just
  talk: say "Hey PAL" and PAL, the lobby computer, answers out loud.
  In any program, F10 brings you back to the main menu.

  This screen is shared: anyone at http://compaq.local on the office
  network sees it too, and can type into it. PAL has a camera and a
  microphone (menu: PAL 286, How PAL works).

